{"id":"ff7a0658d8cf65f6","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-herbrand-structure.md","title":"Herbrand Structure","display":"df-herbrand-structure — Herbrand Structure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-herbrand-structure","aliases":["57-df-herbrand-structure"],"display":"df-herbrand-structure — Herbrand Structure","depends_on":["[[57-df-herbrand-universe]]","[[57-df-herbrand-base]]","[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-term-interpretation]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-herbrand-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-herbrand-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-herbrand-structure — Herbrand Structure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d1505219185e27a3\" href=\"?note=d1505219185e27a3\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-universe\">57-df-herbrand-universe</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ac4f07708b58159c\" href=\"?note=ac4f07708b58159c\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-base\">57-df-herbrand-base</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"701e19aa09901897\" href=\"?note=701e19aa09901897\" title=\"57-df-term-interpretation\">57-df-term-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\neq\\emptyset\">\\(\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\neq\\emptyset\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_S\">\\(B_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d1505219185e27a3\" href=\"?note=d1505219185e27a3\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-universe\">57-df-herbrand-universe</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ac4f07708b58159c\" href=\"?note=ac4f07708b58159c\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-base\">57-df-herbrand-base</a>。固定参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq B_S\">\\(I\\subseteq B_S\\)</span>，表示被赋真的基关系原子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\">\\(c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\">\\(R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq1\">\\(n\\geq1\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak H(S)\">\\(\\mathfrak H(S)\\)</span> 保留原单参数写法，但其真原子集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 是显式环境参数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak H_I(S)\">\\(\\mathfrak H_I(S)\\)</span> 显示该参数。结构与项解释见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"701e19aa09901897\" href=\"?note=701e19aa09901897\" title=\"57-df-term-interpretation\">57-df-term-interpretation</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal I_H(c)&amp;\\coloneqq c,\\\\\n\\mathcal I_H(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\rangle:(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{HU}(S)^n\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal I_H(R)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{HU}(S)^n:R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in I\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak H_I(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathrm{HU}(S),\\mathcal I_H\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathfrak H(S)\\coloneqq\\mathfrak H_I(S).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal I_H(c)&amp;\\coloneqq c,\\\\\n\\mathcal I_H(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle(t_1,\\ldots,t_n),f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\rangle:(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{HU}(S)^n\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal I_H(R)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{HU}(S)^n:R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in I\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak H_I(S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathrm{HU}(S),\\mathcal I_H\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathfrak H(S)\\coloneqq\\mathfrak H_I(S).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak H_I(S),S),\\qquad\n\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak H_I(S))\\quad t^{\\mathfrak H_I(S)}[\\beta]=t.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak H_I(S),S),\\qquad\n\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak H_I(S))\\quad t^{\\mathfrak H_I(S)}[\\beta]=t.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>函数符号取项构造解释，关系解释不能省略。只有基项才在任意赋值下解释为自身；变量项的值由赋值给出，原文件对所有项的无条件等式不成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-herbrand-universe","status":"resolved","id":"d1505219185e27a3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-herbrand-universe]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-herbrand-base","status":"resolved","id":"ac4f07708b58159c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","headin